flowchart TB
    Root[Normality acceptance space] --> Obj[Normal object state]
    Obj --> Part[Part structure]
    Part --> Surface[Surface integrity]
    Surface --> Texture[Regular texture]
    Surface --> Material[Undamaged material]

    NP[Normal patch] -->|low hyperbolic cost| Texture
    NP -->|accepted mass| Accepted[Accepted at low cost]

    DP[Defective patch] -->|violates surface / texture / material| RejectRegion[Outside normality cone]
    RejectRegion -->|accepted only with penalty| HighCost[High-cost accepted evidence]
    RejectRegion -->|mass not accepted| Unmatched[Unaccepted evidence]

    HighCost --> Score[Acceptance-failure score]
    Unmatched --> Score
